"<h3>Cookies</h3>\n"
"<p>As with many websites, we use so-called “cookies”. Cookies are small text files "
"which are transferred to your\n"
"    hard drive by a website server. By means of the cookies, we automatically receive "
"certain data, such as the\n"
"    IP\n"
