"    contained in cookies, we can make navigation easier and enable the correct "
"display of our websites.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Under no circumstances will the data gathered by us be passed on to third parties "
"and no linkage with\n"
"    personal\n"
"    data will take place without your consent.</p>\n"
"<p>Naturally you can generally view our website without cookies. Most internet "
"browsers are generally set to\n"
