"via your browser settings.\n"
"    Please use the help function of your browser to find out how to alter these "
"settings. Please bear in mind\n"
"    that\n"
"    individual functions of our website may not work if you deactivate the cookies.</"
"p>\n"
"<p>Our website only uses technically necessary cookies which are required for the "
"operation and security of the site\n"
